# Data-Acquisition

Python scripts for fetching global fungal occurrence records from public biodiversity databases.

# Data Sources

GBIF https://www.gbif.org/
MyCoPortal https://www.mycoportal.org/

# Files

Fungi Name.xls Input species list with scientific names 
GBIF occurrence obtaining.py Batch query GBIF occurrence records by species name; outputs CSV and shapefile
MyCoPortal occurrence obtaining.py Batch query MyCoPortal occurrence records, with automatic GBIF fallback
Merge occurrence data.py Batch-merge downloaded ZIP archives into combined CSV files 
